<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 18.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 18.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, June 18:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,697.40 (1,696.70)	CHF  1,173.20 (1,175.80)</p>
<p>    DEM    979.46 (979.56)	  GBP  2,779.50 (2,776.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.99 (139.22)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $23.51 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$15.71 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $39.22 million ($36.80 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
